WEBVTT

00:00:13.450 --> 00:00:18.200
<i>Oh Yeah!
Be strong, jump on, become the wind</i>

00:00:13.450 --> 00:00:18.200
<i>Oh Yeah!
tsuyogatte tobinotte kaze ni natte</i>

00:00:18.330 --> 00:00:24.250
<i>Pass the orbit beyond the sky</i>

00:00:18.330 --> 00:00:24.250
<i>oozora kidou wo koero</i>

00:00:36.090 --> 00:00:41.020
<i>Can't hold back this rushing speed</i>

00:00:36.090 --> 00:00:41.020
<i>osaekirenai maenomeri na speed</i>

00:00:41.180 --> 00:00:46.020
<i>A familiar town turns into a diorama</i>

00:00:41.180 --> 00:00:46.020
<i>minareta machi ga diorama ni naru</i>

00:00:46.190 --> 00:00:51.230
<i>Burst through the unclear skies</i>

00:00:46.190 --> 00:00:51.230
<i>futoumei na sora tsukinukerunda</i>

00:00:51.400 --> 00:00:56.410
<i>Blow away your worries and discontent</i>

00:00:51.400 --> 00:00:56.410
<i>nayami toka fuman toka futtobashite</i>

00:00:56.570 --> 00:01:01.830
<i>Who needs a journey that's by the book</i>

00:00:56.570 --> 00:01:01.830
<i>manual doori no tabi nanka irane</i>

00:01:01.990 --> 00:01:07.620
<i>Even if you're lost or trembling,
Raise the altitude</i>

00:01:01.990 --> 00:01:07.620
<i>mayottemo furuetemo koudo agete</i>

00:01:07.790 --> 00:01:12.630
<i>Oh Yeah!
Show off, mess up, stand back up</i>

00:01:07.790 --> 00:01:12.630
<i>Oh Yeah!
ikigatte shikujitte tachiagatte</i>

00:01:12.800 --> 00:01:17.720
<i>The unknown horizon I watch with you</i>

00:01:12.800 --> 00:01:17.720
<i>kimi to mitsumeru michi naru chiheisen</i>

00:01:17.890 --> 00:01:22.600
<i>Now, be strong, jump on, become the wind</i>

00:01:17.890 --> 00:01:22.600
<i>saa tsuyogatte tobinotte kaze ni natte</i>

00:01:22.770 --> 00:01:28.400
<i>Use the sun
That lights tomorrow as a guide</i>

00:01:22.770 --> 00:01:28.400
<i>asu wo terasu taiyou
mejirushi ni shitesa</i>

00:01:28.560 --> 00:01:34.230
<i>Fly off to the Glorious World of freedom</i>

00:01:28.560 --> 00:01:34.230
<i>tonde ike jiyuu na Glorious World</i>

00:01:37.320 --> 00:01:41.200
<i>The mysterious world where Digimon live,
the Digital World.</i>

00:01:43.330 --> 00:01:49.380
<i>Taichi Yagami and the Chosen Ones
with their partner Digimon</i>

00:01:49.540 --> 00:01:54.800
<i>continue their adventure
to stop Millenniumon's resurrection.</i>

00:01:55.670 --> 00:02:00.180
<i>While Taichi's group is scouting
the camping grounds...</i>

00:02:00.840 --> 00:02:02.390
Hurry, hurry!

00:02:02.390 --> 00:02:04.600
No need to get that excited.

00:02:04.600 --> 00:02:07.060
Scout! Scout!

00:02:07.060 --> 00:02:07.980
Huh?

00:02:07.980 --> 00:02:10.100
<i>Up next. Yesterday, the cabinet...</i>

00:02:11.230 --> 00:02:12.770
<i>...in the press conference...</i>

00:02:15.860 --> 00:02:19.360
KING OF INVENTORS, GERBEMON

00:02:22.030 --> 00:02:23.870
CHOROMON

00:02:25.540 --> 00:02:28.330
<i>Due to the Prime Minister's statement...</i>

00:02:29.000 --> 00:02:30.630
Jeez!

00:02:30.620 --> 00:02:33.240
GERBEMON

00:02:30.630 --> 00:02:32.630
This old junk!

00:02:32.630 --> 00:02:35.500
Tyumon, you ready?

00:02:33.240 --> 00:02:35.500
TYUMON

00:02:42.300 --> 00:02:44.230
Looks like there's someone there.

00:02:44.230 --> 00:02:45.390
Yeah...

00:02:46.180 --> 00:02:48.600
Gerbemon, an Ultimate Digimon.

00:02:49.020 --> 00:02:50.400
And Tyumon.

00:02:50.400 --> 00:02:52.030
A Rookie Digimon.

00:02:52.030 --> 00:02:54.690
What could they be doing?

00:02:56.110 --> 00:02:58.900
What's that clunky contraption?

00:03:00.740 --> 00:03:02.360
This time for sure!

00:03:10.750 --> 00:03:13.500
Ugh, another dud!

00:03:15.000 --> 00:03:18.670
Don't be disappointed,
we learn from our mistakes.

00:03:24.010 --> 00:03:25.260
Humans?

00:03:27.100 --> 00:03:31.770
U-Um, this is incredible!
To create such an invention from garbage!

00:03:32.190 --> 00:03:34.980
What do you mean garbage? Eh?!

00:03:35.860 --> 00:03:37.780
This is a mountain of treasure!

00:03:38.650 --> 00:03:43.130
These are all valuable objects
that prove the existence of another world!

00:03:43.130 --> 00:03:45.540
It's a fountain of knowledge!

00:03:45.540 --> 00:03:47.790
A fountain of knowledge...

00:03:47.790 --> 00:03:51.790
One man's trash is another man's treasure
if you change your perspective.

00:03:51.790 --> 00:03:54.050
Assumptions are enemies of science!

00:03:54.050 --> 00:03:55.210
I see!

00:03:55.210 --> 00:03:57.800
Then are these for your studies too?

00:03:57.800 --> 00:03:59.420
No, that's just garbage.

00:04:00.050 --> 00:04:01.050
What the heck?!

00:04:01.050 --> 00:04:06.600
A battery, a motor, a desk lamp,
a washtub, and a rice paddle?

00:04:08.140 --> 00:04:09.600
Instant ramen!

00:04:09.600 --> 00:04:11.140
Can you eat that?

00:04:12.940 --> 00:04:15.150
Looks like it's expired.

00:04:15.150 --> 00:04:16.400
Aww...

00:04:16.400 --> 00:04:17.860
That's no fun.

00:04:17.860 --> 00:04:21.400
Other than that,
there's several household goods... Hm?

00:04:21.940 --> 00:04:23.530
"Katamete Poi Poi!"

00:04:24.360 --> 00:04:25.540
What is it?

00:04:25.540 --> 00:04:28.910
It's used to solidify tempura oil
so you can throw it out easily.

00:04:28.910 --> 00:04:31.130
What a strange item.

00:04:31.130 --> 00:04:32.540
What is that?

00:04:32.540 --> 00:04:35.290
Oh, this is called a tablet and...

00:04:36.630 --> 00:04:38.170
This is amazing!

00:04:38.710 --> 00:04:40.670
What an impressive technology!

00:04:41.210 --> 00:04:42.920
It's a very convenient item.

00:04:43.380 --> 00:04:45.890
Tyumon, let's hurry and disassemble it!

00:04:45.890 --> 00:04:47.180
What?!

00:04:50.010 --> 00:04:50.900
No!

00:04:50.900 --> 00:04:53.600
Come on, just for a little bit!

00:04:54.310 --> 00:04:58.560
By the way, are you a scientist?

00:04:59.020 --> 00:05:03.490
That's right, I am studying this land.

00:05:04.700 --> 00:05:10.750
<i>Black lightning has been roaring for days
in every part of this Eternal Continent.</i>

00:05:10.750 --> 00:05:13.580
<i>But one day, it all stopped abruptly.</i>

00:05:14.460 --> 00:05:19.990
<i>At the same time, all kinds of things
started to fall from the sky.</i>

00:05:19.990 --> 00:05:24.260
<i>And a pile of garbage...
I mean, a mountain of treasure was formed.</i>

00:05:26.010 --> 00:05:30.970
Mm... As a scientist,
I have been studying this area since then.

00:05:31.470 --> 00:05:33.940
The black lightning stopped...

00:05:33.940 --> 00:05:37.900
Because Koshiro-san and I
took care of the ISS.

00:05:37.900 --> 00:05:40.240
Like the refrigerator from before,

00:05:40.240 --> 00:05:43.820
maybe our world's data
mixed in with the black lightning

00:05:43.820 --> 00:05:46.490
and started to materialize everywhere.

00:05:47.110 --> 00:05:50.490
You guys know something, don't you?!

00:05:50.950 --> 00:05:51.960
Whoa.

00:05:51.960 --> 00:05:55.160
Let me hear all about it...

00:05:55.620 --> 00:05:57.500
at my laboratory.

00:05:57.500 --> 00:05:58.370
What?!

00:05:59.420 --> 00:06:01.130
Laboratory?!

00:06:06.220 --> 00:06:08.090
Heave... Ho...

00:06:08.510 --> 00:06:10.350
The remnants of the black lightning...

00:06:10.350 --> 00:06:15.140
Mm, seems like they're accumulating
everywhere in this area.

00:06:15.140 --> 00:06:16.230
Hm.

00:06:18.020 --> 00:06:19.020
Hey...

00:06:19.770 --> 00:06:20.770
What's this?

00:06:23.900 --> 00:06:25.860
I wonder where I got that...

00:06:26.820 --> 00:06:28.780
You can have it! Take it!

00:06:29.490 --> 00:06:30.530
Are you sure?!

00:06:39.080 --> 00:06:41.290
Something stinks...

00:06:45.800 --> 00:06:47.550
What is that?!

00:06:47.550 --> 00:06:50.060
Our accursed archenemy...

00:06:50.060 --> 00:06:51.930
Raremon!

00:06:51.760 --> 00:06:54.300
RAREMON

00:07:01.770 --> 00:07:03.530
What was that attack just now?

00:07:03.530 --> 00:07:06.440
Like they say,
"Keep a lid on your garbage"!

00:07:11.360 --> 00:07:12.490
Tentomon!

00:07:12.490 --> 00:07:13.490
Alrighty!

00:07:14.030 --> 00:07:14.910
Agumon!

00:07:14.910 --> 00:07:15.830
Yeah!

00:07:17.700 --> 00:07:20.040
Agumon Evolution!

00:07:20.040 --> 00:07:21.590
Greymon!

00:07:21.590 --> 00:07:23.920
Tentomon Evolution!

00:07:24.670 --> 00:07:26.090
Kabuterimon!

00:07:27.590 --> 00:07:28.590
My goodness...

00:07:42.190 --> 00:07:44.440
That thing eats anything!

00:07:44.440 --> 00:07:45.480
Kabuterimon!

00:07:46.110 --> 00:07:47.480
Mega Blaster!

00:07:51.780 --> 00:07:53.040
It's not working?

00:07:53.040 --> 00:07:53.990
Greymon!

00:07:55.820 --> 00:07:57.580
Mega Flame!

00:08:02.750 --> 00:08:04.460
Th-That's hot!

00:08:04.460 --> 00:08:05.760
Yeow!

00:08:05.760 --> 00:08:08.250
Raremon's burning hot!

00:08:09.880 --> 00:08:13.390
No attacks will work on Raremon's body.

00:08:13.390 --> 00:08:15.850
What's worse, Raremon gets...

00:08:15.850 --> 00:08:17.010
Raremon gets?

00:08:19.260 --> 00:08:20.270
...gets hungry.

00:08:20.270 --> 00:08:22.180
What?!

00:08:27.730 --> 00:08:29.020
Sticky...

00:08:30.110 --> 00:08:31.490
Raremon left...

00:08:31.490 --> 00:08:33.530
By the way, about that...

00:08:35.990 --> 00:08:37.080
Disassemble...

00:08:37.080 --> 00:08:38.530
No!

00:08:39.660 --> 00:08:41.000
I see.

00:08:41.000 --> 00:08:46.170
So the black lightning has something to do
with Millenniumon's resurrection.

00:08:46.170 --> 00:08:47.170
Yes.

00:08:47.170 --> 00:08:50.510
And you children are
the Chosen Ones from the rumors.

00:08:50.510 --> 00:08:55.350
That's right. We're all heading toward
this place called FAGA.

00:08:55.350 --> 00:08:59.300
What you told me just now...
That's really bad.

00:09:00.140 --> 00:09:02.100
No, the tea is good.

00:09:02.100 --> 00:09:03.560
Uh-huh...

00:09:03.560 --> 00:09:04.770
Listen well.

00:09:04.770 --> 00:09:10.860
If the black lightning
that accumulated here affects Raremon...

00:09:11.480 --> 00:09:14.110
imagine what terrible things might occur.

00:09:16.240 --> 00:09:19.990
By the way, what are all those cups?

00:09:23.700 --> 00:09:29.130
Before, many Tyumon used to assist me.

00:09:31.250 --> 00:09:35.720
However, all who stood in
that thing's way were...

00:09:37.760 --> 00:09:43.180
Every time I look at these ownerless cups,
I am reminded of how powerless I am.

00:09:43.770 --> 00:09:47.100
I will not allow that thing
to disturb my research!

00:09:48.400 --> 00:09:51.900
And I must avenge all Tyumon...

00:09:53.230 --> 00:09:56.740
I will finish off
that despicable Raremon with this!

00:09:59.160 --> 00:10:01.290
A... bazooka.

00:10:01.290 --> 00:10:02.200
That's...

00:10:02.700 --> 00:10:05.500
This is the Absolute Zero Bazooka.

00:10:05.500 --> 00:10:10.380
It's an amazing weapon that freezes
and breaks its opponent with ice bullets!

00:10:11.420 --> 00:10:14.430
Incredible!
And you made this from garbage...

00:10:14.430 --> 00:10:17.350
This is past the point of recycling.

00:10:17.350 --> 00:10:20.640
It's as if pulling something
out of thin air!

00:10:22.680 --> 00:10:24.600
A true genius!

00:10:38.780 --> 00:10:39.740
What is it?!

00:10:43.990 --> 00:10:45.830
The black lightning...

00:10:46.330 --> 00:10:48.830
The buried lightning have leaked out!

00:11:09.730 --> 00:11:11.190
That Gerbemon...

00:11:11.190 --> 00:11:14.900
Why do I need to bring all this junk?

00:11:17.900 --> 00:11:20.570
Raremon is getting closer
to the black lightning!

00:11:21.110 --> 00:11:24.450
Oh no! Tyumon, maximum pressure!

00:11:37.050 --> 00:11:39.010
Revenge, huh...

00:11:39.800 --> 00:11:42.010
<i>It may not be a good thing to do...</i>

00:11:43.300 --> 00:11:44.640
<i>But there must be...</i>

00:11:45.640 --> 00:11:49.180
some sort of pain that can only be
understood by the ones left behind.

00:11:49.980 --> 00:11:52.020
In people and Digimon too.

00:11:52.520 --> 00:11:53.860
Koshiro-san?

00:11:53.860 --> 00:11:54.820
Oh...

00:11:54.820 --> 00:11:56.490
No, it's nothing.

00:11:56.490 --> 00:12:01.410
Um, Gerbemon, don't we have to wait
for Taichi-san and Greymon?

00:12:01.410 --> 00:12:04.290
Isn't there anything you need
on that cart?

00:12:04.290 --> 00:12:06.870
Those things are worthless.

00:12:06.870 --> 00:12:09.290
They're all just straight-up garbage!

00:12:09.750 --> 00:12:11.040
W-What?!

00:12:14.250 --> 00:12:17.130
That's not finished yet.

00:12:19.420 --> 00:12:23.880
Do not worry!
From here, this is a battle of my own!

00:12:24.890 --> 00:12:27.640
If worst comes to worst,
I leave Tyumon to you!

00:12:29.060 --> 00:12:30.220
Gerbemon!

00:12:30.560 --> 00:12:33.890
Don't tell me Gerbemon
is trying to do it all alone!

00:12:34.690 --> 00:12:37.150
This is for all Tyumon!

00:12:40.530 --> 00:12:41.820
Take this!

00:12:45.570 --> 00:12:46.700
Gerbemon!

00:12:56.420 --> 00:12:57.790
Did it work?

00:13:01.090 --> 00:13:02.180
Wow!

00:13:02.180 --> 00:13:03.590
It's a success!

00:13:07.720 --> 00:13:09.850
The black lightning's
wrapped around Raremon!

00:13:16.850 --> 00:13:18.610
I've failed!

00:13:21.940 --> 00:13:22.990
What?!

00:13:24.070 --> 00:13:25.320
Gerbemon!

00:13:26.530 --> 00:13:28.620
A-And Raremon?

00:13:37.330 --> 00:13:38.630
Rareraremon...

00:13:40.210 --> 00:13:41.880
Raremon has evolved.

00:13:42.760 --> 00:13:44.880
RARERAREMON

00:13:45.300 --> 00:13:46.390
Kabuterimon!

00:13:46.390 --> 00:13:48.640
Alright! Bring it on!

00:13:49.050 --> 00:13:51.810
Kabuterimon Super Evolution!

00:13:52.180 --> 00:13:54.150
Atlurkabuterimon!

00:13:54.150 --> 00:13:56.140
Here I go!

00:14:01.320 --> 00:14:04.230
What? Didn't faze you at all, eh?!

00:14:05.280 --> 00:14:06.740
How's this?!

00:14:11.120 --> 00:14:12.160
Gerbemon!

00:14:13.620 --> 00:14:15.830
This smell... It's oil.

00:14:16.210 --> 00:14:21.670
Lately, that thing's favorite food is
machines powered by oil.

00:14:21.670 --> 00:14:24.720
We did see Raremon
eating cars at first too.

00:14:24.720 --> 00:14:30.050
After eating junk like that,
Rareraremon's body's filled with oil.

00:14:31.470 --> 00:14:32.690
Oil...

00:14:32.690 --> 00:14:35.720
That body is mostly oil...

00:14:37.730 --> 00:14:38.690
What if...

00:14:39.020 --> 00:14:40.560
KATAMETE POI POI!

00:14:46.570 --> 00:14:48.200
What are you doing?!

00:14:50.450 --> 00:14:52.320
Horn Buster!

00:14:56.120 --> 00:14:58.080
Almost got eaten there!

00:15:02.580 --> 00:15:04.920
This is going nowhere!

00:15:07.970 --> 00:15:10.550
Greymon Super Evolution!

00:15:11.050 --> 00:15:12.470
Metalgreymon!

00:15:14.050 --> 00:15:18.480
Taichi-san, that cart of garbage...
Uh, I mean, materials...

00:15:18.480 --> 00:15:21.350
Yeah, I brought it of course!

00:15:21.850 --> 00:15:23.740
What do we do with this?

00:15:23.740 --> 00:15:24.770
Okay.

00:15:25.820 --> 00:15:27.900
You aren't powerless at all!

00:15:28.440 --> 00:15:30.990
I will prove that to you!

00:15:35.200 --> 00:15:36.990
I believe it was in here...

00:15:38.870 --> 00:15:39.750
Here it is!

00:15:40.750 --> 00:15:44.880
Taichi-san, Metalgreymon,
please lend me a hand!

00:15:44.880 --> 00:15:45.750
Sure!

00:15:48.800 --> 00:15:51.760
Now, what do we do, Koshiro-san?!

00:15:52.260 --> 00:15:55.770
Attack from the sky
to draw Rareraremon's attention!

00:15:55.770 --> 00:15:57.900
Alright, leave it to us!

00:15:57.900 --> 00:15:58.770
Yeah!

00:16:11.030 --> 00:16:14.700
What are you thinking? That's useless now!

00:16:14.700 --> 00:16:17.410
No, that's not true!

00:16:17.410 --> 00:16:19.580
You learn from your mistakes.

00:16:19.580 --> 00:16:23.170
A change of perspective.
Meaning, we'll change how we use it!

00:16:23.170 --> 00:16:25.590
Just like how you taught us.

00:16:25.590 --> 00:16:27.090
Me?

00:16:30.260 --> 00:16:31.920
Good, this is it.

00:16:32.340 --> 00:16:33.840
Put this on the cooler...

00:16:34.970 --> 00:16:35.930
Tyumon.

00:16:35.930 --> 00:16:37.430
Thank you.

00:16:48.690 --> 00:16:49.650
There!

00:16:52.150 --> 00:16:53.200
Good.

00:16:53.530 --> 00:16:55.410
<i>Taichi-san, how are things?</i>

00:16:55.410 --> 00:16:58.000
Yeah, I'm doing just as you said.

00:16:58.000 --> 00:16:59.670
Just a bit more.

00:16:59.670 --> 00:17:03.620
By the way, Koshiro,
what are you gonna do with this?

00:17:06.380 --> 00:17:09.000
Thanks! This is the last batch!

00:17:13.760 --> 00:17:14.880
I'm done here too!

00:17:15.470 --> 00:17:18.770
Atlurkabuterimon, spin Rareraremon around!

00:17:18.770 --> 00:17:20.930
That sounds like fun!

00:17:24.020 --> 00:17:27.020
Whoops... Here it goes!

00:17:27.560 --> 00:17:30.520
Hup!

00:17:36.240 --> 00:17:37.530
It's blending!

00:17:37.990 --> 00:17:40.080
Koshiro, what's next?!

00:17:40.080 --> 00:17:43.210
Please heat up that body with Giga Storm!

00:17:43.210 --> 00:17:45.790
But Atlurkabuterimon will also...

00:17:45.790 --> 00:17:49.130
Go ahead! Give it your best shot!

00:17:49.130 --> 00:17:51.920
I believe in Koshiro-san!

00:17:52.710 --> 00:17:54.800
Alright. Metalgreymon!

00:17:55.260 --> 00:17:56.380
Okay!

00:17:58.220 --> 00:18:00.350
Giga Storm!

00:18:02.220 --> 00:18:05.310
Ow! Ow! Here it comes!

00:18:07.100 --> 00:18:10.770
Good! The heat is mixing it
with the body's oil!

00:18:12.610 --> 00:18:14.320
You're ready too?

00:18:17.070 --> 00:18:18.360
And now...

00:18:18.820 --> 00:18:20.830
Koshiro-kun...

00:18:20.830 --> 00:18:25.040
Yeow! Must bear with it!

00:18:28.000 --> 00:18:31.880
Alright! Atlurkabuterimon, get back!

00:18:31.880 --> 00:18:32.960
Right-o!

00:18:36.130 --> 00:18:40.090
We'll increase the cooler's power
with Metalgreymon's energy!

00:18:41.350 --> 00:18:42.350
Now, this should...

00:18:45.060 --> 00:18:46.850
Koshiro-kun...

00:18:47.270 --> 00:18:49.610
Taichi-san, please!

00:18:49.610 --> 00:18:51.440
Y-Yeah.

00:18:51.440 --> 00:18:52.980
Metalgreymon!

00:18:52.980 --> 00:18:53.980
Yeah.

00:19:01.320 --> 00:19:03.790
Energy charged at 100%.

00:19:03.790 --> 00:19:04.740
Fire!

00:19:07.500 --> 00:19:10.250
If freezing won't work,
we can solidify the body!

00:19:10.250 --> 00:19:13.000
Just like how you use
waste oil hardener...

00:19:13.460 --> 00:19:16.760
You pour it in while the oil's hot,
mix it, and cool it!

00:19:17.380 --> 00:19:18.680
Giga Storm heats the oil.

00:19:18.680 --> 00:19:24.100
Atlurkabuterimon's spinning mixes
the hardener with the oil in the body.

00:19:24.100 --> 00:19:27.430
And if we cool that body
with the upgraded bazooka...

00:19:34.320 --> 00:19:35.900
Please hold up!

00:19:42.490 --> 00:19:43.700
Koshiro-kun...

00:19:45.620 --> 00:19:46.700
How did it go?!

00:19:55.630 --> 00:19:58.220
Oh, we did it!

00:19:58.220 --> 00:20:01.220
Rareraremon's completely solid!

00:20:04.090 --> 00:20:05.770
We did it, Koshiro!

00:20:05.770 --> 00:20:06.850
Yes!

00:20:09.730 --> 00:20:13.230
He's really done it...

00:20:17.400 --> 00:20:20.530
But to think Koshiro
would push himself this far.

00:20:20.530 --> 00:20:22.830
Well, things sure got heated up there!

00:20:22.830 --> 00:20:25.120
I know. I'm sorry.

00:20:25.120 --> 00:20:28.790
No, no, I'm talking about Koshiro-san.

00:20:30.160 --> 00:20:31.500
Koshiro-kun.

00:20:31.500 --> 00:20:36.210
You've shown me
your dedicated soul for science.

00:20:36.540 --> 00:20:39.930
No, if it wasn't for your invention...

00:20:39.930 --> 00:20:42.010
It's all thanks to you.

00:20:43.220 --> 00:20:44.260
From here on...

00:20:44.720 --> 00:20:49.770
please focus on your desired research
without being haunted by revenge.

00:20:49.770 --> 00:20:52.770
Koshiro-kun, thank you.

00:20:59.570 --> 00:21:01.530
SEARCHMON

00:21:01.940 --> 00:21:04.570
You evolved?!

00:21:05.410 --> 00:21:07.500
Hm... Searchmon, eh?

00:21:07.500 --> 00:21:11.250
You evolved when you thought
you should take after Koshiro-kun?

00:21:11.250 --> 00:21:12.670
I see, I see!

00:21:12.670 --> 00:21:14.040
Oops! Ahh!

00:21:18.630 --> 00:21:21.050
From now on, we'll search together!

00:21:21.050 --> 00:21:24.470
Let's set out to our next research!

00:21:31.060 --> 00:21:33.140
<i>The border has now begun to blend</i>

00:21:31.060 --> 00:21:33.140
<i>ima mazari atteku border</i>

00:21:33.310 --> 00:21:35.980
<i>"It's uncharted territory from here!"</i>

00:21:33.310 --> 00:21:35.980
<i>koko kara wa jinrui mitou desu!</i>

00:21:36.150 --> 00:21:38.520
<i>Blue skies, the ends of the ocean</i>

00:21:36.150 --> 00:21:38.520
<i>aoi sora umi no hate</i>

00:21:38.690 --> 00:21:42.610
<i>All that you desire awaits you</i>

00:21:38.690 --> 00:21:42.610
<i>nozomu kagiri no subete ga aru kara</i>

00:21:53.750 --> 00:21:55.870
<i>The end doesn't exist, that's right</i>

00:21:53.750 --> 00:21:55.870
<i>owari nanka nai ze sou sa</i>

00:21:56.040 --> 00:21:58.540
<i>We're at our starting point right now</i>

00:21:56.040 --> 00:21:58.540
<i>koko wa ima bokura no shuppatsuten</i>

00:21:58.710 --> 00:22:01.170
<i>Blue skies, the ends of the ocean</i>

00:21:58.710 --> 00:22:01.170
<i>aoi sora umi no hate</i>

00:22:01.340 --> 00:22:04.760
<i>There's a tomorrow that no one knows about</i>

00:22:01.340 --> 00:22:04.760
<i>dare mo shiranai asu wa aru kara</i>

00:22:04.920 --> 00:22:06.760
<i>So keep on smiling</i>

00:22:04.920 --> 00:22:06.760
<i>waratte iyou</i>

00:22:06.930 --> 00:22:10.720
<i>We're past the point of stopping
In our daily lives</i>

00:22:06.930 --> 00:22:10.720
<i>imasara tachidomarenu bokura no
nichijou jou</i>

00:22:10.890 --> 00:22:12.220
<i>Bring on the unknown!</i>

00:22:10.890 --> 00:22:12.220
<i>michi joutou!</i>

00:22:12.390 --> 00:22:14.560
<i>That day, I drew on the wall with you</i>

00:22:12.390 --> 00:22:14.560
<i>ano hi kimi to kabe ni kaita</i>

00:22:14.730 --> 00:22:17.190
<i>The incomplete, the imperfect</i>

00:22:14.730 --> 00:22:17.190
<i>mikansei wo fukanzen wo</i>

00:22:17.350 --> 00:22:19.900
<i>"You can't go anywhere at this point"</i>

00:22:17.350 --> 00:22:19.900
<i>imasara doko e mo ikenai ze tte</i>

00:22:20.060 --> 00:22:22.610
<i>Oh, is that so?! Oh, is that so?!</i>

00:22:20.060 --> 00:22:22.610
<i>aa sou kai nee! aa sou kai nee!</i>

00:22:22.780 --> 00:22:28.700
<i>Then we don't want to become a grown-up</i>

00:22:22.780 --> 00:22:28.700
<i>nara otona ni nanka natcha ikenai nee</i>

00:22:31.200 --> 00:22:32.830
<i>The Digimon Encyclopedia!</i>

00:22:34.240 --> 00:22:35.200
<i>Nanimon.</i>

00:22:35.370 --> 00:22:37.920
LEVEL: CHAMPION

00:22:35.370 --> 00:22:38.710
<i>An unknown Digimon known as "Oyaji."</i>

00:22:37.920 --> 00:22:40.590
TYPE: INVADE

00:22:38.870 --> 00:22:41.250
<i>Nanimon's special attack is
"Unchi"... "Poop"?!</i>

00:22:40.590 --> 00:22:43.340
SPECIAL MOVE: UNCHI / UNCHI DUNK

00:22:41.420 --> 00:22:43.210
<i>I definitely don't wanna get hit!</i>

00:22:43.500 --> 00:22:45.840
<i>N-Now, let's check this out!</i>

00:22:46.010 --> 00:22:49.800
<i>Nanimon is manly! So manly
that you'll never forget that face!</i>

00:22:49.970 --> 00:22:52.390
<i>Nanimon is a macho-mon!</i>

00:22:53.060 --> 00:22:55.060
<i>I just told a dad joke...</i>

00:22:57.690 --> 00:23:00.100
<i>Which Digimon will it be next time?</i>

00:23:01.730 --> 00:23:03.150
<i>Etemon and Volcamon.</i>

00:23:03.320 --> 00:23:07.900
<i>The heated match
over the King of Digimon title begins.</i>

00:23:08.070 --> 00:23:11.740
<i>Next time on Digimon Adventure:
"Clash, the King of Digimon"</i>

00:23:11.910 --> 00:23:14.580
<i>The adventure continues to a new world.</i>
